<title>UK: Banco Bradesco sets $50 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Bradesco sets $50 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BRADESCO SA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     7.80 PCT  MATURITY    18.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.947    PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.947    SPREAD	+190 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.375     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
